#: index.docbook:291
msgid	"If you are in Business card view you can use this menu item (or the "
	"Toolbar <guiicon>Edit entry</guiicon> icon) when you want to "
	"<action>edit the current entry</action>, rather than changing to "
	"<guimenuitem>Editing</guimenuitem> view with the "
	"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Editing</guimenuitem>"
